<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pasminco says could pay year div.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pasminco says could pay year div.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Base metals miner Pasminco Ltd said on Wednesday it would pay a dividend based on its financial results for the 1996/97 year (July-June) if current market conditions are maintained.</p>
<p>Pasminco earlier said it would not declare a dividend for the first half.</p>
</text>
